<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's jobless rate fell 3.0 pct yr/yr March.</title>
<headline>Portugal's jobless rate fell 3.0 pct yr/yr March.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of registered unemployed in Portugal fell 3.0 percent year-on-year to 472,092 in March, 1.8 percent down on the previous month, the Institute for Employment and Professional Training (IFEP) said.</p>
<p>				   March 97   Feb 97    March 96</p>
<p> Registered unemployed     472,092   480,583     486,932</p>
<p> NOTE -</p>
<p>The IEFP does not express the number of unemployed as a percentage of the total labour force. Its figures for the number of people out of work are consistently higher than those of the National Statistics Institute (INE) -- the government's official yardstick for unemployment.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
